  "notes": "{降|ふ}り{出|だ}す is a compound verb (⟦{降|ふ}る→降る：00839_furu⟧ + ⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧) meaning to start falling (rain/snow).\n\nCOMPOUND VERB PATTERN:\n〜{出|だ}す indicates the beginning of an action.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{雨|あめ}→雨：00583_ame⟧が{降|ふ}り{出|だ}す (rain starts falling)\n- ⟦{雪|ゆき}→雪：00584_yuki⟧が{降|ふ}り{出|だ}す (snow starts falling)\n- ⟦{急|きゅう}に→急：13042_kyuu⟧{降|ふ}り{出|だ}す (suddenly starts raining)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{降|ふ}り{止|や}む→降り止む：27987_furiyamu⟧: to stop raining/snowing\n- ⟦{降|ふ}り{続|つづ}く→降り続く：21878_furitsuzuku⟧: to keep raining/snowing",
